Layout table lines:
  STRUCT <name>
  FIELD <name> <kind> <offset> <size>

Kinds: u32, u64. Sample blobs are little-endian packed fields in field order.
sched_entity fields include pid, weight, migration_flags, slice_ns.

procance.tag is one line: live:<release> or bundle:<release>
offline guard stamp: /app/lagpipe/synctab_out/offline_guard.ok

